  <description>
    DRAFT: s500_custom_with_ardupilot.
    This model includes a temporary mass and geometry adaptation for S500:
    - Base link mass adjusted so total mass is 2.400 kg.
    - Rotor positions updated assuming a symmetric X frame with 485.93 mm diagonal distance.
    - Propeller collision radius updated for 11x4.5 inch props (0.1397 m), visual scale adjusted. Simulation target prop is APC1147.
    - NOTE: CAD CG and inertia values were provided and mapped to model coordinates, but when subtracting the rotor link contributions from the total CAD inertia, the resulting base_link inertia violated the triangle inequality (physically impossible). Therefore, base_link inertia remains Iris default until a consistent mass/inertia distribution is resolved.
  </description>
</model>
